    "diagnosis": "The complete pair contains sound guidance/role distinctions and no evidenced earlier forecast error. Later electronics-qualified headlines sharing a stock token expose a recurring class of attribution risk alongside the original fund/issuer and supplier/buyer cases. Make issuer, claim-owner and listing checks explicit in the NEWS miner so this sound reasoning becomes a repeatable procedure. This is preventive procedure codification, not a lesson proven by price error.",
