    "change": {
      "node_id": "lab_miner_news",
      "skill_addon": "Use only as-of supplied facts and preserve S_/N_ IDs. Before assigning a headline to a stock, resolve the claim owner, corporate entity and listing; distinguish parent/subsidiary, buyer/supplier and fund/issuer. A ticker tag or shared brand is insufficient. If unresolved, mark association unverified and exclude it from issuer profit or price attribution. Compare matching periods and units; never convert growth into price return or financing size into dilution. Missing feeds limit support; invent no metrics."
